  "behavior": [
    "WithProviderObservationSelection owns a copy of provider record selections keyed by original observation identity. Omission retains every provider; an explicit empty list excludes provider records from that observation.",
    "Original receipts validate before selection. Unknown observations, unknown providers, duplicate providers, non-provider sources, and corrupt excluded receipts fail.",
    "Selection precedes conflicts, collection, review-candidate evidence, and primary membership. Remaining records retain their original receipt, identity, and checksum. No observation payload is cut down or rewritten.",
    "Baseline facts remain. Selection does not remove reviewed authored definitions. The option performs no storage writes."
  ],
